{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one ever truly understood what happened that day.<br>It was an ordinary, quiet morning. Work dragged on slowly, until several miners suddenly begged to shut everything down \u2014 struck by a strange, unexplainable sickness. At first, everyone thought it was simple exhaustion. But the weariness soon turned to panic... and then to unrestrained madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gunshot echoed across the yard. The deranged worker collapsed, lifeless \u2014 but it was already too late. The girl survived, though her injuries were horrific. Her grief-stricken father would have traded all his wealth for a single thing \u2014 a cure for his daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up, not remembering how you got here.<br>What is this place? How long have you been out?<br>None of that matters \u2014 heavy footsteps echo beyond the wall, and you know it\u2019s time to get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving through the dark corridors is extremely dangerous. The real challenge lies in the constant lack of resources and relentless enemies that never let you rest. Combat demands your full attention and control \u2014 but remember, you don\u2019t always have to fight. Sometimes the only way to survive is to run and hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person survival horror focused on its horror experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of unique and deadly weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/73cf03b979c329c29506d230b5920298.poster.avif?t=1767279301\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/73cf03b979c329c29506d230b5920298.webm?t=1767279301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/73cf03b979c329c29506d230b5920298.mp4?t=1767279301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balanced yet dangerous enemies and brutal, uncompromising combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/9c62f6a0374b67941c40a35da1da0f51.poster.avif?t=1767279301\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/9c62f6a0374b67941c40a35da1da0f51.webm?t=1767279301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/9c62f6a0374b67941c40a35da1da0f51.mp4?t=1767279301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story steeped in heart-freezing terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration filled with essential items, hidden secrets, and clever Easter eggs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/dd22b675e092f7a75f454a1c581e346f.poster.avif?t=1767279301\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/dd22b675e092f7a75f454a1c581e346f.webm?t=1767279301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050940/extras/dd22b675e092f7a75f454a1c581e346f.mp4?t=1767279301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamst